      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat 2026.2.3 (OPEN BETA) - June 17, `Build 1863` (https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202623-open-beta#fixes--changes-1):\n\n- Fixed Hype Train icon not showing updated information reliably for instances in the Main Menu.",
